stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> received
    received --> routing
    routing --> context_ready
    context_ready --> running
    running --> waiting_approval
    waiting_approval --> running: aprovado
    waiting_approval --> cancelled: negado ou expirado
    running --> completed
    running --> failed
    running --> cancelled
    completed --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
